-- title:
--   Interpolation weight $a_j$ as the quotient $H_j / D_{j+1}$
-- statement:
--   Below the terminal index the interpolation weight is the quotient of the two auxiliary sequences: for natural numbers $N$ and $j$ with $j < N$,
